---
---

<section data-testid="research" id="research" class="py-20 lg:py-28">

	<p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">02 — Research</p>
	<h2 class="mb-4 font-monospace text-3xl text-black dark:text-white lg:text-5xl">
		How we learned what users actually need
	</h2>
	<p class="mb-14 max-w-xl text-base leading-loose text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
		8 semi-structured interviews with Chinese immigrants living in Seattle (1–10 years in the US).
		Sessions were in-person and via Zoom. Participants lived alone or had limited social networks.
	</p>

	<!-- Affinity diagram -->
	<div class="mb-16">
		<figure>
			<img
				src="/images/palup/affinity_diagram.png"
				alt="Affinity diagram clustering 6 major themes from interview data"
				class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-lg ring-1 ring-black/5"
				loading="lazy"
			/>
			<figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-sm text-gray-500">
				Affinity diagram — 6 major themes clustered from interview data
			</figcaption>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<!-- Key themes grid -->
	<div class="mb-16 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
		<div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
			<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">Theme 1</p>
			<p class="mb-2 font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">Conversation &gt; Cuisine</p>
			<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
				Conversational fit was prioritized over food preferences when evaluating potential dining
				companions — consistently across all participants.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
			<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">Theme 2</p>
			<p class="mb-2 font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">Group Size Matters</p>
			<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
				4 people was cited as ideal — small enough to talk meaningfully, large enough to reduce
				awkward silences.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
			<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">Theme 3</p>
			<p class="mb-2 font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">Safety Is a Prerequisite</p>
			<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
				Trust mechanisms were non-negotiable for female participants — safety was expected, not a
				bonus feature.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900">
			<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">Theme 4</p>
			<p class="mb-2 font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">The Bad Cycle</p>
			<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
				Fewer friends → less dining out → harder to meet people. A self-reinforcing isolation loop the
				app needed to break.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!-- Persona -->
	<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-10 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:gap-16">
		<div class="lg:w-1/3">
			<p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange">User Persona</p>
			<p class="mb-4 font-monospace text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white">Angela Zhang</p>
			<p class="text-base leading-loose text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
				28 · Software Engineer · Seattle. Loves communal dining, struggles to find compatible
				companions without it feeling like a date. Represents our core user: recently relocated,
				independent, socially motivated but constrained.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="w-full lg:w-2/3">
			<figure>
				<img
					src="/images/palup/persona.png"
					alt="User persona card for Angela Zhang"
					class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-lg ring-1 ring-black/5"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
